:- encoding(utf8).
/*  iq input/output pairs: 200 test vectors computed from each target's
    mathematical definition (targets.pl), and checked against the circuit
    iq derives for that target.

    io(Id, Target, NQubits, Input, Output)
      Input  : basis index k of the input state |k>  (qubit b holds bit b of k)
      Output : list of J-amp(P, T), the nonzero amplitudes of U|k>, where
               amplitude of |J> = sqrt(P) * e^{2 pi i T}
               P = probability, T = phase in turns; both exact rationals.

    Load with:  ?- consult('data/io_pairs.pl').
    Rationals use SWI-Prolog's NrD syntax (e.g. 1r8).
*/
:- discontiguous io/5.

